	~%100%ἀγοράν#Correct: **ἀγοράν** is the correct form for acc. sing. of the noun “marketplace” (Chapter 1).
	~%-100%χώραις#Incorrect. **χώραις** is the dat. pl. of the noun “territory”  (Ch. 1).
